flowchart TB
    API["FastAPI create_character → job pending"] --> V["validate_node: MIME/크기\n이름/설명은 Pydantic; 보유/횟수는 Django"]
    V --> LLM["llm_persona_node\nLLMPort: qwen / runpod / fake\nRetryPolicy 최대 3 attempts"]
    V -->|사진 있을 때| SRC["source_upload_node\n기존 URL passthrough 또는 storage PUT\nRetryPolicy 최대 4 attempts"]
    LLM --> SYNC["sync"]
    SRC --> SYNC
    SYNC --> IG["image_generator_node\nImageGeneratorPort: local / runpod / mock\n최대 2 attempts"]
    IG -->|성공| GU["generated_upload_node\n실제 S3 또는 LocalStorage\n최대 4 attempts"]
    GU -->|성공| BLD["builder_node → CharacterEntity"]
    BLD --> DONE["job done → Celery → Django SUCCEEDED\nFE polling → preview → 입주 CONSUMED"]
    IG -->|실패| CLN["cleanup_source_image → error"]
    GU -->|실패| CLN
    BLD -->|실패| CLN
    MOCK["IMAGE_PROVIDER=mock\n고정 64×64 PNG, GPU/외부 모델 미사용"] -.-> IG
    V -->|검증 실패| ERR["job error → Django FAILED"]
    LLM -->|재시도 소진| ERR
    SRC -->|재시도 소진| ERR
    CLN --> ERR
